P2 type:bug #65 epic:design-system fix(design-system): FocusManager shadows Flutter's, OptimizedListView hides errors on an empty list, and every screen-reader string is hardcoded English
P2 type:task #64 epic:core-network fix(architecture): the contracts layer is largely dead - INetworkClient is bypassed, dio leaks into a feature, and the three slices teach three different shapes
